<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?> <?xml-stylesheet type="text/xsl" href="rss.xsl"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"> <channel> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title><description>SONiC NOS（sonic-net/SONiC）の日本語非公式ドキュメント</description><link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link><atom:link href="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /> <docs>https://github.com/aoki-taquan/sonic-unofficial-docs</docs><language>ja</language> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:15:59 -0000</pubDate> <lastBuildDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:15:59 -0000</lastBuildDate> <ttl>1440</ttl> <generator>MkDocs RSS plugin - v1.19.0</generator> <image> <url>None</url> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link> </image> <item> <title>変更履歴</title> <category>changelog</category> <category>meta</category> <description>変更履歴 — このページは merged PR のメタデータから meta/scripts/gen_changelog.py で機械生成されています。手で編集しないでください。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/changelog/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:13:49 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/changelog/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/changelog.png" type="image/png" length="19713" /> </item> <item> <title>DIP=SIP PTF 検証 概念（テストの目的とトポロジ）</title> <description>DIP=SIP PTF 検証テストの概念・目的・トポロジ・対応 testbed を整理する。SONiC が「SRC_IP = DST_IP」のパケットを正しく L3 ルーティングできるかを sonic-mgmt の PTF / pytest で検証するテストインフラ HLD。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-concepts/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:13:49 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-concepts/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-concepts.png" type="image/png" length="31944" /> </item> <item> <title>DIP=SIP PTF 検証 内部実装（パケット仕様 / パラメータ）</title> <description>DIP=SIP PTF 検証テストの dip_sip.py パラメータと送受信パケット仕様（DIP=SIP のまま L3 ルーティング、TTL/HL が 1 減って受信される）を整理する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-internals/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:13:49 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-internals/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-internals.png" type="image/png" length="26248" /> </item> <item> <title>DIP=SIP PTF 検証 制限事項と HLD-実装乖離（pytest 移行）</title> <description>DIP=SIP PTF 検証テストの制限事項・干渉する機能・トラブルシューティング、および ansible/ptftests から sonic-mgmt/tests/ipfwd/test_dip_sip.py (pytest) への移行に伴う HLD-実装乖離を整理する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-limitations/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:13:49 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-limitations/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-limitations.png" type="image/png" length="39543" /> </item> <item> <title>DIP=SIP PTF 検証 運用（ファイル構成 / 前処理 / 実行）</title> <description>DIP=SIP PTF 検証テストの sonic-mgmt 配下ファイル構成と Ansible 前処理ワークフロー、実行コマンドを整理する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-operations/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:13:49 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-operations/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-operations.png" type="image/png" length="26687" /> </item> <item> <title>DIP=SIP PTF 検証テスト</title> <description>DIP=SIP PTF 検証テスト — 「DIP（destination IP）と SIP（source IP）が同じ」L3 パケットを SONiC スイッチが正しくルーティングできるかを PTF (Packet Test Framework) で検証 するテストの設計。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:13:49 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design.png" type="image/png" length="30488" /> </item> <item> <title>Error Handling Framework 概念（ERROR_DB / SWSS_RC / 報告のみの責務）</title> <description>Error Handling Framework HLD の概念整理。SAI 失敗を fatal 扱いせず ERROR_DB 経由で app に伝搬する設計思想、framework 自体は report のみで retry/rollback を担わない責務分担、対象 table と SWSS error code 体系を解説する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/error-handling-framework-in-sonic-concepts/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:13:49 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/error-handling-framework-in-sonic-concepts/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/error-handling-framework-in-sonic-concepts.png" type="image/png" length="50069" /> </item> <item> <title>Error Handling Framework 内部実装（OrchAgent producer / ErrorListener / ASIC_DB notification）</title> <description>Error Handling Framework HLD の内部実装。OrchAgent が SAI 失敗を ASIC_DB notification channel 経由で受け取り ERROR_DB へ producer として書き込む経路、ErrorListener の register API と pub/sub 受信、SAI 失敗から SWSS_RC への翻訳点を解説する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/error-handling-framework-in-sonic-internals/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:13:49 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/error-handling-framework-in-sonic-internals/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/error-handling-framework-in-sonic-internals.png" type="image/png" length="52509" /> </item> <item> <title>Error Handling Framework 制限事項と HLD との乖離（コア機構未実装 / CRM 代替）</title> <description>Error Handling Framework HLD の制限事項。SWSS_RC enum だけが先行採用され ERROR_DB / ErrorListener / CLI は丸ごと未実装な部分採用状況、サイレント RIB-FIB 乖離リスク、CRM (Critical Resource Monitor) ベースの代替運用設計を詳述する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/error-handling-framework-in-sonic-limitations/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:13:49 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/error-handling-framework-in-sonic-limitations/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/error-handling-framework-in-sonic-limitations.png" type="image/png" length="47177" /> </item> <item> <title>Error Handling Framework 設定・運用（show / clear error-database / ERROR_DB スキーマ）</title> <description>Error Handling Framework HLD の CLI / ERROR_DB スキーマ。`show error-database` / `sonic-clear error-database` の使い方（HLD 提案、現行 master 未実装）、ERROR_ROUTE_TABLE / ERROR_NEIGH_TABLE のフィールド、イベント遷移表をまとめる。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/error-handling-framework-in-sonic-operations/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:13:49 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/error-handling-framework-in-sonic-operations/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/error-handling-framework-in-sonic-operations.png" type="image/png" length="52034" /> </item> <item> <title>SmartSwitch HA HAMgrD 概念（actor model と vDPU 抽象）</title> <description>HAMgrD の概念。NPU 側 actor model、vDPU 抽象、HA Set / HA Scope の役割、DPU-Driven / Switch-Driven mode の違いを整理する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-concepts/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:13:49 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-concepts/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-concepts.png" type="image/png" length="57541" /> </item> <item> <title>SmartSwitch HA HAMgrD 内部実装（actor workflow / DPU-Driven 詳細）</title> <description>HAMgrD の内部実装。actor 起動と動的変動、DPU と vDPU の状態集約、HA Set / HA Scope の workflow、DPU-Driven mode のシーケンスを扱う。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-internals/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:13:49 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-internals/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-internals.png" type="image/png" length="51969" /> </item> <item> <title>SmartSwitch HA HAMgrD 制限事項と実装乖離</title> <description>HAMgrD の制限事項と実装乖離。community master 上で hamgrd バイナリ未取り込み、DASH_HA_DPU_STATE / VDPU_TABLE 未定義、swbus 不在、Switch-Driven mode TBD など、HLD と実装の差分を整理する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-limitations/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:13:49 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-limitations/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-limitations.png" type="image/png" length="41475" /> </item> <item> <title>SmartSwitch HA HAMgrD CONFIG/APP/STATE_DB スキーマ（設定経路）</title> <description>HAMgrD の設定経路。DASH_HA_GLOBAL_CONFIG / DASH_HA_SET_CONFIG / DASH_HA_SCOPE_CONFIG テーブル、対応する STATE 系テーブル、現状実装で書き込み可能な部分の運用検証コマンド例を扱う。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-operations/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:13:49 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-operations/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-operations.png" type="image/png" length="39023" /> </item> <item> <title>SmartSwitch HA: HAMgrD（NPU 側 actor 分割と DPU 連携）</title> <description>SmartSwitch HA: HAMgrD（NPU 側 actor 分割と DPU 連携） — hamgrd は SmartSwitch の NPU 側 HA container 内で動く管理デーモン。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:13:49 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design.png" type="image/png" length="54076" /> </item> <item> <title>SSD ヘルスチェック 概念（SsdBase / SsdUtil 二段プラグイン）</title> <description>SONiC の SSD ヘルスチェック機能（show platform ssdhealth + ssdutil プラグイン）の概念と二段プラグインアーキテクチャ（SsdBase / SsdUtil）を整理する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design-concepts/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:13:49 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design-concepts/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/ssdhealth-design-concepts.png" type="image/png" length="43432" /> </item> <item> <title>SSD ヘルスチェック 内部実装（API 仕様 / ssdmond）</title> <description>SONiC の SSD ヘルスチェック機能の API 仕様（SsdBase / SsdUtil の public method）と Optional 常時監視デーモン ssdmond の設計を整理する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design-internals/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:13:49 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design-internals/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/ssdhealth-design-internals.png" type="image/png" length="40377" /> </item> <item> <title>SSD ヘルスチェック 制限事項と HLD-実装乖離</title> <description>SONiC の SSD ヘルスチェック機能の制限事項・干渉する機能・トラブルシューティング、および現行 master と HLD 記述の乖離（ssdutil への移行、sonic_storage 再構成、ssdmond 未取り込み）を整理する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design-limitations/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:13:49 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design-limitations/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/ssdhealth-design-limitations.png" type="image/png" length="30008" /> </item> <item> <title>SSD ヘルスチェック 運用（CLI / 表示モード）</title> <description>SONiC の SSD ヘルスチェック機能の CLI（show platform ssdhealth）の使い方と 3 表示モード（brief / verbose / vendor）、設定の有無を整理する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design-operations/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:13:49 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design-operations/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/ssdhealth-design-operations.png" type="image/png" length="32564" /> </item> <item> <title>SSD ヘルスチェック（show platform ssdhealth + ssdutil プラグイン）</title> <description>SSD ヘルスチェック（show platform ssdhealth + ssdutil プラグイン） — SONiC が動く NOS は組み込み SSD / mSATA に書き込みを行うため、ストレージの寿命と健全性を運用者が把握できる 必要がある。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:13:49 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/ssdhealth-design.png" type="image/png" length="49361" /> </item> </channel> </rss>